  <item>
    <title>Vol.08 来了嗷！南海大地艺术节观展导览手册！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67d8391d78103db3bd067c1b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67d8391d78103db3bd067c1b</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 17 Mar 2025 15:31:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你是否想象过，在碧海蓝天之间，邂逅一场艺术的盛宴？</span></p><span></span><p><span>你是否好奇，当艺术融入自然，扎根本土，会碰撞出怎样的火花？</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期节目，轩然大播向你奉上广东南海大地艺术节观展导览手册，跟随我们的声音，一期节目带你走遍南海大地艺术节的各个展区，开启一场别开生面的艺术之旅！</span></p><span></span><p><span>↓↓↓</span><strong><span>观展导览手册由此开启↓↓↓</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a> 广东南海大地艺术节简介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="667">11:07</a> </span><em><strong><span>——-听音湖展区-——</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="800">13:20</a> </span><strong><span>香云纱</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhFBlTC-CAt2_EA3rK4fg5IBJrVq.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1058">17:38</a> </span><strong><span>《百家大屋》 </span></strong><span>by.绘造社</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrOX5Vyxx_pOdomkVnC_CGc3eeDW.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1184">19:44</a> </span><strong><span>《第三天堂》</span></strong><span> by. Michelangelo Pistoletto</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv-WSlS28GsxV17uW36DlxYbjmVe.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1279">21:19</a> ——</span><em><strong><span>-西樵山展区-——</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1288">21:28</a> </span><strong><span>喵喵庙</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvEAPGZpa8B8gtXpUr1xsWPdTsFd.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1474">24:34</a> </span><strong><span>《听山》</span></strong><span> by.朱哲琴</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FifQxWSMTJA4PH3jAAKPSdWRayaD.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1608">26:48</a> </span><strong><span>《大地剧场》 </span></strong><span>by.吴子元</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh9IyY7UBiX212EipnsR5WCtJ84T.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1736">28:56</a> </span><strong><span>《高升》</span></strong><span> &nbsp;by.BAM百安木</span></p><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnTemopkt1KXy6gsZCDDxe1DGFzX.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1878">31:18</a> “鸡蛋花队”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1986">33:06</a> </span><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong><em><strong><span>——-儒溪村展区-——</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2115">35:15</a> </span><strong><span>《蚕的协奏曲》 </span></strong><span>by.松本秋则</span></p><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkGnMpYLOrOmt1yEZPli3I9rqfpl.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2449">40:49</a> </span><strong><span>《进化中的尘埃》 </span></strong><span>by.向阳</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiNHlJ5yhUSiZe4RPIhA2i6TCHzt.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2737">45:37</a> </span><em><strong><span>——-渔耕粤韵展区-——</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2798">46:38</a> </span><strong><span>《香蕉在背后成熟》 &nbsp;</span></strong><span>by. Alexander Ponomarev</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2854">47:34</a></span><strong><span> 《山海禅灯》 </span></strong><span>by. 王欣+孙玥</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhbPBcIQm6mgGtmsmPKC2LIh8C9M.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3057">50:57</a> </span><strong><span>《井木间》</span></strong><span> by. 罗宇杰+彭斯</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsVotTlzHUl1Mw-LxiWwSI362Vw0.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3210">53:30</a> </span><strong><span>《垂直的自然》</span></strong><span> by. 徐浪+冯瑞</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhCmwl4MZnpggoht0Ykn-5hkDXss.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3380">56:20</a> </span><strong><span>《野草博物馆》</span></strong><span> by. 吴林寿+沈瑞筠</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnzKLx7MIx65dvEie0CN-8uRO36i.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3496">58:16</a> </span><strong><span>《南海声殿》 </span></strong><span>by. 王灏+秦思源+史劼</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpbs2pJzOMUmHYvJjysPaH1sGg8x.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3683">61:23</a> </span><strong><span>《霁竹亭.水边》</span></strong><span> by. 范久江+薛峰</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkCl87tlsxpHgSzqwXebLWDn860G.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3859">64:19</a></span><em><strong><span> ——-平沙岛展区-——</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4039">67:19</a> </span><strong><span>《光之森林》 </span></strong><span>by.藤本壮介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4120">68:40</a> 《</span><strong><span>五亿年前的礼物》 </span></strong><span>by.淺井裕介</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhsMfWoeBtJ70U23WrAgt9Kyu8FD.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4394">73:14</a> </span><em><strong><span>——-太平墟展区-——</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4553">75:53</a> </span><strong><span>《家的风景》</span></strong><span> by.刘芊岑</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FijJV_twbSWqGYME6emUKI8gCzA-.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4680">78:00</a> </span><strong><span>《时间灯塔》</span></strong><span> by.马岩松</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrOK45FvVFwgntle1fvLl6Z7lIfo.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4800">80:00</a> 鹭鸟归巢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4935">82:15</a> </span><em><strong><span>——-烟南村展区-——</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4945">82:25</a> </span><strong><span>《无忧屋》</span></strong><span> by.马岩松</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoFV0lslr536ptxjRxYVPzPy9IV4.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5026">83:46</a> </span><strong><span>《月亮的眼泪》</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnESTsdAl8Nbylhbssy79AmSAJW3.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5199">86:39</a> </span><strong><span>《宅生记》 </span></strong><span>by.庞海龙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5380">89:40</a> </span><strong><span>《金花</span></strong><span>》 by.王忠升</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5447">90:47</a> </span><em><strong><span>——-璜矶社区-——</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5447">90:47</a> </span><strong><span>《池塘星之街》</span></strong><span> by.回春堂</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhSCUPyz6o4XObzzXLwvPGcqnYYY.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5447">90:47</a> </span><strong><span>《得闲饮酒》</span></strong><span> by.罗冰梅</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsFu8N_OrrMaA1cCqCasrfXFHKTF.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5817">96:57</a> </span><strong><span>《飞翔的龙舟》</span></strong><span> by. Sordo Madaleno Arquitectos + WUA Studio</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm0mOz740OGlZ_jvz996YZNLUnB2.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
