  <item>
    <title>Vol.07 来了嗷！2025普奖得主刘家琨|用砖石搭建人本主义乌托邦之梦</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67cc76cf0766616acd8e5433</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67cc76cf0766616acd8e5433</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 08 Mar 2025 19:25:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>"2025年，普利兹克奖的桂冠落在中国建筑师刘家琨的头顶。他的建筑，从本土出发，低语着东方的哲学与诗意。砖石、混凝土、光影，在他的手中化为流动的诗行，讲述着人与自然的永恒对话。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>在这期播客中，我们将走进刘家琨的建筑世界：从西村大院的烟火乌托邦，到鹿野苑石刻博物馆的静谧光影；从御窑金砖博物馆历史的幽冥天光，到胡慧珊纪念馆映照的人本光辉。感受他如何用现代语言诠释传统精神，如何在城市与乡村之间搭建桥梁，又如何用建筑去实现人居环境的乌托邦理想。</span></p><span></span><p><span>让我们一起聆听砖石间的诗篇，感受刘家琨的建筑之美。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="149">02:29</a> 普利兹克奖-建筑界最高荣誉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="185">03:05</a> 本土建筑师刘家琨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">05:30</a> 意大利建筑师卡洛斯卡帕与刘家琨生涯的共性（阿然ADHD病发实录）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="578">09:38</a> 写作的经验给刘家琨的设计带来了什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="758">12:38</a> 漫谈刘家琨代表作品（鹿野苑石刻博物馆，御窑金砖博物馆，西村大院，胡慧珊纪念馆...)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3020">50:20</a>可汗大点兵，畅想下一位有望获得普奖的本土建筑师会是谁呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3687">61:27</a> 聊聊对张永和"国美良渚校区"的感受</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>相关图片</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjzoHaSiSTVqs_jaQvgYwDSSrdJq.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>鹿野苑石刻博物馆-刘家琨</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsezHC08Rsx1PNQQorSp7WfHM313.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>御窑金砖博物馆-刘家琨</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtcNbgzjO2C8cdzoZ_5Dgoc2FLsx.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>西村大院-刘家琨</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl-uf4djULSHG00HPSs7vVRYBZj-.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>"再生砖计划"</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsw6iAA6l-scz-BZJRRlWmUQtP3b.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>胡慧珊纪念馆</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsJgsJA0kV3iTHI7jB32FWdDcs1V.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>何多苓工作室-刘家琨</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkO7-Db-mRmz3NQzZWUWlwEq8mDo.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>垂直玻璃宅-张永和</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvEch0PWZq0FO80X8yM5RpSXqwXO.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>中国美术学院良渚校区-张永和</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk15qA8S2IXU4oE6WICbuN1JFbMH.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>柏林犹太博物馆-Daniel Libeskind</span></strong></em></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66680f17d9a97b62d13df8f3/loJaT9l9LL0X0zY4CAxBAFWvDhV3.m4a" length="102311849" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:10:29</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtyIt6dPngiz2YXfnz0PYkc16PQ6.png"/>
