  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.06 来了嗷！从红城到沙漠，阿轩的摩洛哥梦境之旅</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67bde41c05a90dfd0dd58779</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67bde41c05a90dfd0dd58779</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 25 Feb 2025 15:55:38 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>还记得《卡萨布兰卡》里英格丽·褒曼的惊鸿一瞥吗？这个北非国度远不止浪漫的爱情故事。这个假期，阿轩踏上了摩洛哥的土地，从红色之城马拉喀什的喧嚣集市，到撒哈拉沙漠的浩瀚星空，从千年古城菲斯的迷巷，到蓝色小镇舍夫沙万的童话世界，拉巴特的白色城墙与卡萨布兰卡的现代风情交织，编织出一段北非的诗意旅程。在这期播客中，我们将与你分享摩洛哥的色彩、故事与心跳，带你走进一个遥远却真实的梦境。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="236">03:56</a> 摩洛哥自驾有什么需要注意的的地方？当地司机彼此间的暗号是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="345">05:45</a> 于红城马拉喀什的半日，熙攘的不眠广场与星月夜下回荡的古兰经是我对摩洛哥的初印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="853">14:13</a> “昨天晚上做了个梦，我走进撒哈拉沙漠”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1495">24:55</a> 菲斯古城路上观察琐记</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2377">39:37</a> 舍夫沙万，一场由半山腰洒落而下的蓝色梦境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2599">43:19</a> 如果可以我想葬在拉巴特的墓地，紧挨一派澄明与蔚蓝的海岸线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2690">44:50</a> 相遇在卡萨布兰卡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2825">47:05</a> 摩洛哥的市井生活，以及在此次旅途中我的那些心情消费</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3450">57:30</a> Tinariwen-响彻沙漠的自由之声</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4140">69:00</a> 彩蛋。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>相关图片 by.阿轩</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmmICrrWiIM0jxH8uS-vuW8wBzDM.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>不眠广场，马拉喀什</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjoxb34xQ_0PzUyc9NMotp4IqDrh.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>公路商店</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnfXGwSt3J-N0MyfYxhWGPEJUqHd.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>翻越阿特拉斯山脉</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiT5rJv_6pYJwCGOQHgvjHkbJKLd.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>撒哈拉沙漠的落日</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FokvquXZDlJ1LUSsyzH_VMxnapLP.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>沙漠营地</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvDl0GAV6aCkDstUZU3rGH05zQXY.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>菲斯的皮革厂</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmbLafUBC9M6qvEc34cOq2yRVI2m.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>于菲斯皮革厂购入的骆驼皮包</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlPS6ha36o41NgHlpogIOwkabkO4.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>地毯铺</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrUTKRV0NdWisZ9vHlt4jLnng7IG.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>舍夫沙万的蓝</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FibkotLf33YhZFm3LZxAohiefvE4.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>拉巴特靠着海岸的墓地</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqKme19hLwkw4Lr_yMxezy0OQDWx.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>贯穿旅行全程的薄荷茶</span></strong></em></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66680f17d9a97b62d13df8f3/lo8LEvreS0tP1V_zHUJ_bxCReFnW.m4a" length="105110513" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:12:25</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fupm_ztqBB8Y2DK6fwpHLX__vyWt.png"/>
